[engl]
{100}{}{Sherry}
{200}{}{You see Sherry.}
{210}{}{You see a gang member.}
{1000}{}{[AUTO-GENERATED SKELETON: replace this entry with the NPC's initial greeting and
conditions.]}
{1010}{}{[MANUAL: initial branch condition/greeting -> Sherry22]}
{2000}{}{Hi! How are you doing? It's been a while.}
{2010}{}{I'm all right, thanks.}
{2020}{}{I've been better.}
{2030}{}{Okay. How about you?}
{2040}{}{I need your help. I need your testimony to put away the Skulz for good.}
{3000}{}{I'm sorry to hear that! Perhaps you should get a room and sleep it off. Talk to
Marcelles. Oh, and here, I can fix you something to eat, if you like.}
{3010}{}{No thanks, but I'll see you around.}
{3020}{}{That would be swell, thanks.}
{4000}{}{Oh, I'm doing much better, thanks! I do some cooking now at the Skum Pitt and the Crash
House. It gets kind of tiresome on some nights, but I do like to cook, and I get to meet
all sorts of interesting people. And I get paid, too. Thanks for your help.}
{4010}{}{[Done.]}
{5000}{}{You want me to turn in my friends?!?}
{5010}{}{Sorry. Forget I asked.}
{5020}{}{Yes, I need your information.}
{5030}{}{They have been hurting people, and they will go on hurting people unless they're
stopped. You changed your life for the better. Now you have a chance to help improve the
lives of others, too.}
{6000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Sherry27a']}
{6010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Sherry28]}
{6020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Sherry29]}
{7000}{}{Hmm. Well, I mean, they are my friends. But I guess that they shouldn't be allowed to
hurt people the way they do. And I guess I trust you since you helped me. All right.}
{7010}{}{[Done.]}
{8000}{}{No, I can't do that! Those are my friends! I may not be a Skul anymore, but I'm not
going to turn my back on my old friends.}
{8010}{}{[Done.]}
{9000}{}{Oh, it's you again! You know, it's probably not healthy to hang out here if you're not
one of the Skulz. And you're not.}
{9010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Goodbyes]}
{9020}{}{Yeah, well, your Skulz probably couldn't knock over a sleeping Brahmin, much less take
on me.}
{9030}{}{What have you been up to lately?}
{10000}{}{Really? We'll see about that! Victor!}
{10010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> SherryCombat]}
{11000}{}{Not too much, actually. There's not much to do. I mean, Shark has been causing some
fights at the Skum Pitt, as usual, but what else is there to do around here?}
{11010}{}{Uh, not much, I guess.}
{11020}{}{You could always try doing something else. You must have some talents or hobbies.}
{12000}{}{Well, I do sort of like to draw. And Vinnie says I'm a pretty good cook. But I mean,
hey, we have fun and stuff, you know?}
{12010}{}{I guess that's understandable.}
{12020}{}{But what will you do when you get older? Where will your life go? How will you make
money?}
{13000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Sherry18a']}
{13010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Sherry19]}
{13020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Sherry20]}
{14000}{}{Um, well, I never gave it much thought. I mean, Vinnie and Victor make some money and
Shark occasionally does some bodyguarding for visitors here. I don't know.}
{14010}{}{You should probably get out while you still can.}
{15000}{}{I guess. I never thought about it much.}
{15010}{}{[Done.]}
{16000}{}{Hey, lay off! You sound like Vinnie's parents used to. We all support each other, okay?
So back off.}
{16010}{}{[Done.]}
{17000}{}{Who are you and what are you doing here?
---
I'm
---
. I'm new to this town.}
{17010}{}{None of your business, wench!}
{17020}{}{Puwah?}
{18000}{}{Take off, you hoser, before one of us decides to tear you up.}
{18010}{}{Yeah? Bring it on!}
{18020}{}{Sheesh, sorry.}
{19000}{}{You sorry thing. You should run along. It's not safe here, especially for someone like
you who wouldn't understand.}
{19010}{}{[Done.]}
{20000}{}{There you go. Enjoy. And I'll see you around!}
{20010}{}{[Done.]}

